{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31179","headline":"酬泗州韦中丞埇上日寄赠兼次本韵 · 薛能","name":"酬泗州韦中丞埇上日寄赠兼次本韵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"鲁儒相悟欲成空，学尽文章不见功。\n官自掖垣飘海上，镇从随岸入山中。\n尝遭火发瞿云宅，争得天如老氏弓。\n何意杜陵怀宝客，也随迷路出关东。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"薛能","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31179.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31179","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}